<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Cimpor to post Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Cimpor to post Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal will issue its first quarter results on Thursday after the market closes at 1530 GMT, a spokesman said.</p>
